  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORTALECIMIENTO DE LAS CAPACIDADES ORGANIZATIVAS DE LOS JVENES, CON INICIATIVAS DE EMPRENDIMIENTOS ECONMICOS Y ENFOQUE DE GNERO EN 6 MUNICIPIOS DE LA ZONA NORTE DE MORAZN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people between the ages of 1826 have the highest rates of unemployment in El Salvador. Youth have relatively low levels of civil engagement and are often stigmatized as being criminals. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security. Our grantee partner the Fundacin Segundo Montes (FSM) assists young people to improve their communities in the municipalities of Meanguera, Jocoaitique, and San Fernando in the department of Morazn, by training them in leadership, strengthening youth-led organizations, and supporting youth-led microenterprises. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
